# The normal wallpaper path is shared by the grid, shelves and return navigation.
phase SetClock
press a
phase Shelf
snap grid-first
press r1
snap grid-second
press down
snap grid-pico8
press l1
press up
press a
snap opened-shelf
press b
snap returned-grid
press menu
phase QuickMenu
press b
phase Shelf
snap returned-from-menu
press x
snap search-keyboard
press b
snap cancelled-search
